  "id": 217190774,
  "iid": 10290,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "MySQL: Improve handling of caching_sha2_password after AuthSwitch",
  "description": "Situation:\n\n- Server: MySQL 8.0.32 with `default_authentication_method=\"caching_sha2_password\"` (default)\n- Client: `mysql --default-auth=mysql_native_password ...`\n- Account password hash type: `caching_sha2_password`\n\nPackets:\n- Packet 4: Server Greeting with `mysql.auth_plugin == \"caching_sha2_password\"`\n- Packet 6: Login Request with `mysql.client_auth_plugin == \"mysql_native_password\"`\n- Packet 8: Auth Switch Request with `mysql.auth_switch_request.name == \"caching_sha2_password\"`\n- Packet 9: Auth Switch Response\n- Packet 10: Caching_sha2_password: `fast_auth_success`\n\nWithout this MR packet 10 doesn't get decoded correctly.\n\n\nWith this MR:\n```\n$ ./run/tshark -Y mysql -r mysql_auth.pcapng  \n    4 0.000216138 3306 35928 MySQL 144 0 Server Greeting  proto=10 version=8.0.32 \n    6 0.000255751 35928 3306 MySQL 252 0 Login Request user=root \n    8 0.000308361 3306 35928 MySQL 114 0 Auth Switch Request \n    9 0.000463656 35928 3306 MySQL 102 0 Auth Switch Response \n   10 0.000494978 3306 35928 MySQL 72 0 Caching_sha2_password fast_auth_success   ←------------------\n   11 0.000529240 3306 35928 MySQL 93 0 Response  OK \n   13 0.000569215 35928 3306 MySQL 105 0 Request Query\n   14 0.000695352 3306 35928 MySQL 204 0 Response TABULAR Response  OK \n   16 2.615153467 35928 3306 MySQL 106 0 Request Query\n   17 2.615584918 3306 35928 MySQL 216 0 Response TABULAR Response  OK \n   19 2.615827845 35928 3306 MySQL 188 0 Request Query\n   20 2.616131677 3306 35928 MySQL 362 0 Response TABULAR Response  OK \n   21 2.616272847 35928 3306 MySQL 71 0 Request Statistics\n   22 2.616396070 3306 35928 MySQL 206 0 Response \n   24 3.662802064 35928 3306 MySQL 71 0 Request Quit\n```\n\nWithout this MR:\n```\n$ ./run/tshark -Y mysql -r mysql_auth.pcapng  \n    4 0.000216138 3306 35928 MySQL 144 0 Server Greeting  proto=10 version=8.0.32 \n    6 0.000255751 35928 3306 MySQL 252 0 Login Request user=root \n    8 0.000308361 3306 35928 MySQL 114 0 Auth Switch Request \n    9 0.000463656 35928 3306 MySQL 102 0 Auth Switch Response \n   10 0.000494978 3306 35928 MySQL 72 0 Response                    ←------------------\n   11 0.000529240 3306 35928 MySQL 93 0 Response  OK \n   13 0.000569215 35928 3306 MySQL 105 0 Request Query\n   14 0.000695352 3306 35928 MySQL 204 0 Response TABULAR Response  OK \n   16 2.615153467 35928 3306 MySQL 106 0 Request Query\n   17 2.615584918 3306 35928 MySQL 216 0 Response TABULAR Response  OK \n   19 2.615827845 35928 3306 MySQL 188 0 Request Query\n   20 2.616131677 3306 35928 MySQL 362 0 Response TABULAR Response  OK \n   21 2.616272847 35928 3306 MySQL 71 0 Request Statistics\n   22 2.616396070 3306 35928 MySQL 206 0 Response \n   24 3.662802064 35928 3306 MySQL 71 0 Request Quit\n```\n\n[mysql_auth.pcapng](/uploads/9f7af31017a2c3d6e4bb709c15b98b17/mysql_auth.pcapng)",
